    "title": "Panthers Improve Each Round at G-MAC Championship to Close 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago FLORENCE, Ind. – The Kentucky Wesleyan men's golf team finalized their 2026 campaign in the Great Midwest Championship at Belterra Golf Club. The Panthers shot 938 as a team and improved each round, culminating in a 309 in round three. Wesleyan placed 8th among the 11 teams, defeating rival Thomas More as well as Northwood and Walsh. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
